>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NORMATIVE-WEAVING-COUNT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
*> 未来因子缓存使用两个固定记录数组轮换，但构建新层时立即释放已消费的旧层单元。
*> 动态 BigInt 的峰值因此保持在线性数量级（最多约一层 5779 个值加常数个临时量），
*> 不再按 remaining/opened/closed 状态向量的组合数量增长。
01 CACHE-INITIALIZED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-VALID PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-M PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-OPENED PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-LENGTHS.
   05 CACHE-LENGTH OCCURS 47 TIMES PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-CURRENT-ID PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-NEXT-ID PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-A-LIMIT PIC 9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-B-LIMIT PIC 9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CACHE-A-TABLE.
   05 CACHE-A-ITEM OCCURS 5779 TIMES.
      10 CA-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
      10 CA-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
      10 CA-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
      10 CA-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 CACHE-B-TABLE.
   05 CACHE-B-ITEM OCCURS 5779 TIMES.
      10 CB-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
      10 CB-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
      10 CB-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
      10 CB-TAIL USAGE POINTER.

